# Purpose

This Constitutional Governance Standard establishes the enterprise documentation standards governing the creation, maintenance, revision, organization, and lifecycle management of all Constitutional Governance (CG) documents within the HCGO Enterprise Architecture.

These standards ensure Constitutional Governance documents remain authoritative, searchable, auditable, traceable, and maintainable throughout the lifecycle of TAD Concepts products and future domains.

